<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on J Sainsbury.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on J Sainsbury.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on J Sainsbury Plc, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    3.15 STG		  PREMIUM B/E  10 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.316 STG		 GEARING	9.9 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	17.FEB.98		 PAYDATE	06.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  315 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
